From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 22:10:28 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] misc: kona-caph: import Broadcom CAPH/AudioH chal helpers

Broadcom's GPL "chal" register helpers for the Capri audio hub, copied
byte-for-byte from Roku's linux-3.0.82-grsec GPL release
(arch/arm/mach-capri/chal/, arch/arm/mach-capri/include/{chal,mach},
arch/arm/plat-kona/include/plat). Kept unchanged so they can be diffed
against the source; the MC74 glue follows in the next commit.

Co-Authored-By: Vas <banoz@users.noreply.github.com>
